(7719673, 1270138, 87808, '<td valign="top">Nice down pour! Very monsoon is. Some one though is going to whine about the tree tops or top of the buildings on the right side. Personally, with this down pour, I would have bumped that contrast a bit to get a really smart level of layers. If under those clouds at the lip a little burn could have make them even more of a curl and dramatic.</td>', 'Nice down pour! Very monsoon is. Some one though is going to whine about the tree tops or top of the buildings on the right side. Personally, with this down pour, I would have bumped that contrast a bit to get a really smart level of layers. If under those clouds at the lip a little burn could have make them even more of a curl and dramatic.', '2022-05-04 09:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
