(7734902, 1269816, 29535, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry this didn''t get any comments at the time!<br/> <br/>The composition you chose is FANTASTIC honestly, it''s so difficult to find one in clouds as they are so random. The colours look great. You can see there''s a little bit of noise/grain due to the editing, but overall I think this is a good entry!<br/> <br/>I hope to see you back again for future challenges!</td>', 'I''m sorry this didn''t get any comments at the time! The composition you chose is FANTASTIC honestly, it''s so difficult to find one in clouds as they are so random. The colours look great. You can see there''s a little bit of noise/grain due to the editing, but overall I think this is a good entry! I hope to see you back again for future challenges!', '2022-12-18 13:37:29.000000', NULL, 0);
